Description: real-time data server for the TRIGA IPR-R1 reactor
 TrigaServer reads real-time values from the TRIGA IPR-R1 nuclear
 reactor (SystemAtom SPU via Modbus-RTU and the control-table PLC
 via OPC UA) and shares them on the network as CSV over TCP.
 .
 A systemd unit is shipped but not enabled or started on install,
 because the service talks to site-specific hardware. After
 installing, review /etc/trigaserver.conf and then:
 .
   systemctl enable --now trigaserver
